   286	maximally mixed state on the weak-composition register (`O(n log N)` qubits), two QSVT spectral
   287	projectors (D-qsvt, D-projectors) at `O~(alpha_BE/Delta_N . log(1/eps'))` block-encoding uses each,
   288	Hadamard test; `O(1/eps)` rounds with amplitude estimation. Total
   289	`O~(poly(n, log N)(alpha_I/Delta_I + alpha_J/Delta_J)/eps)`. Reading an *exponent* needs
   290	`tau_{2N}/tau_N` to relative accuracy `1/4`, so `eps = Theta(tau_N)` and `Omega(1/tau_N)` rounds, and
   291	needs `N >~ mu_cap` (N3): honest bound `O~(poly(n, N, mu_cap, alpha_BE/Delta_N)/tau_N)`. Against the
   292	classical `Omega(M_N)` per filter the margin is exactly `M_N` -- exponential when `N = Theta(n)`, but
   293	it is arm A's margin for `HF/M_N` applied to a concatenated generator list, not a new one. Space
   294	`O(n log N)` qubits versus `M_N` words is not by itself a separation (fact SP-0, PRD D15) and must be
   295	stated as a simultaneous (space, time) claim (D-space-time-pareto).
